 Use numeric IDs from the separate tables, never IRIs, labels or packet string IDs. The start and predicate must belong to the same graph. Forward follows a stored subject-predicate-object statement from subject to object. Reverse follows that same stored predicate from object to subject; do not invent an inverse property.
